        <field
            name="summary"
        >Alberta rates 8%, 10%, 12%, 13%, 14% and 15% from 61,200, 154,259, 185,111, 246,813 and 370,220 (the first bracket of 8% applies since 2025); basic personal amount 22,769; K1P and K2P at 8%; supplemental tax credit K5P = ((K1P + K2P) - 4,896.00) x 0.25, 0 if negative.</field>
